  "description": "ShadowDusk HLSL front-end: FX9 pre-parse, preprocessor, DXC integration (HLSL to SPIR-V/DXIL; bundles the pinned DXC v1.9.2607 natives), and the vkd3d-shader DXBC backend (HLSL to SM1–5 D3D bytecode for the DirectX and FNA targets; bundles the vkd3d 2.1 natives for win-x64/linux-x64/osx-x64/osx-arm64). Part of the ShadowDusk.Compiler cross-platform MonoGame/KNI/FNA shader compiler.",
